          <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,10" Text="Configure the CP/M SSC driver first (CONFIGIO on compatible Microsoft disks). Match baud and flow control. For A2Z R, route RDR: and PUN: to the SSC; leave CON: on the Apple. For a remote CP/M prompt, CON: must instead be routed to serial."/>
